### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@labId = 1
@roomId = 1
@csrfToken = replace-with-xsrf-cookie-value

### Create room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "labId": {{labId}},
  "name": "Chemistry Room 101",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT_ROOM",
  "floor": 1,
  "area": 42.50
}

### View all rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### View rooms by lab
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?labId={{labId}}

### Search rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?search=chem

### View room by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### Update room
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Chemistry Room 101A",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT_ROOM",
  "floor": 1,
  "area": 45.00
}

### Deactivate room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/deactivate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Activate room (the parent lab must be active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/activate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
